    <tags>markmyvod video editing streamer vod marker timestamp chapters windows portable</tags>
    <summary>Local Windows hotkey tool for marking stream highlights and exporting editor-ready timestamps.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
MarkMyVOD Lite is a free, local Windows tool for marking important moments while recording or streaming.

Features:

* Global `Ctrl+Shift+M` marker hotkey
* Optional notes and editable timestamps
* Save and reopen sessions locally
* Export CSV and YouTube chapter timestamps
* No account, advertising, telemetry, or background network activity
* Portable application with no installer

The Lite edition supports up to 10 markers per session. The separately available full edition adds unlimited markers, JSON and CMX 3600 EDL export, and exact local MP4 clip export.

The executable is currently unsigned, so Windows SmartScreen may display an unknown-publisher warning.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>Initial Chocolatey package for MarkMyVOD Lite 1.0.0.</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
